ed complete small native project with configured human quorum, actual review-start transaction, complete retained original contexts and an explicitly synthetic host verifier.","18.j uses isolated small complete native projects, actual original revisions and synthetic host provenance/authority, never inferred human approval."],"primary_verification_id":"SR-VER-0012","required_environment":{"declared_minimum_python":"3.10","implementation":"cpython","measured_scope":"current-run-only"},"requirement_id":"SR-REQ-0171","resources":{"harness_suite_timeout":null,"harness_test_timeout":null,"owned_temporary_files":true},"specification_sha256":"35ecde6ed87eceabc0831caf01bc51a4bbc685fd5257b6eb688c1673bef6e970","steps":["Invoke the native proposal review writer with an explicit human decision and optional comment, retaining content binding and every prior history row.","Observe distinct human actor_ids reaching the configured quorum, an insufficient count remaining in_review, original canonical assessment bytes and actual writer completion.","Compare public argv and structured request under the same explicit host context; dry-run preserves normative files, journal and receipt inventory.","Repeat a human decision and reject AI/CI review calls, including dry-run; stale or revoked host evidence does not fill the quorum.","Verify exact request replay and decision/comment conflicts, actual stored-row tampering, missing originals, stale basis, denied authority and retained real interrupted-staging journal.","Perform explicit negative human decisions through native proposal review; compare full original content binding, retained history, exact revision and actual completion.","Withdraw only the same human approval: in_review keeps status, approved becomes rejected; reject foreign/nonhuman/absent approvals and require an explicit withdrawal reason.","Compare public argv and structured requests, including dry-run with unchanged project/journal/receipt inventory.","Check real request re